          "text": "Left shoulder pain triggers"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Pain increases with abduction above approximately 90°, reaching behind the back, overhead work, and lying on the left side. No clear trauma; increased gardening and tightening bolts on the ute, and possibly sleeping awkwardly in a recliner."
      }
    },
